    "description": "<p>You construct a large claw of your design made of semi-solid compressed wind chakra. You can attack with it targeting a single creature up to 30 feet away. Make a ranged ninjutsu Attack. Target Creature takes 5d6 Wind damage and the affected creature makes a Constitution saving throw, gaining 2 ranks of Bleed on a failed saving throw.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
